                      "name": "Card 2 Title",
                      "fill": "#A855F7",
                      "content": "2. 电视遥控器 D-Pad 单层导航与手感",
                      "fontFamily": "Outfit",
                      "fontSize": 20,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "qDQdv",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 首屏双层结构：上方大时钟/日期，下方常用应用 Dock 玻璃底板，按遥控器 [下键] 平滑滚动到全部应用。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "PGA4J",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 极致可见焦点：焦点态放大 1.08x，带有 #38BDF8 天空蓝呼吸光晕和白色立体底板，在 3 米客厅一目了然。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "a3OONS",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 边界阻断防丢焦：Dock 左右边缘显式设定 nextFocus，禁止遥控器连击时光标跳飞或陷入空节点。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zFBrf",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 遥控器快捷键：[MENU 菜单键] 呼出壁纸与设置面板；[OK 键] 短按启动、长按呼出管理；[BACK 键] 从网格返回 Dock 首屏。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "z7Lpi",
              "name": "Bento Column 2",
              "width": 882,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "lcRfm",
                  "name": "Card 3 - Glass Dock Fallback",
                  "width": 882,
                  "height": 406,
                  "fill": "#1E293B",
                  "cornerRadius": 24,
                  "stroke": "#334155",
                  "strokeWidth": 1,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": [
                    28,
                    32
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "lVZQr",
                      "name": "Card 3 Title",
                      "fill": "#10B981",
                      "content": "3. 玻璃底板 (Glass Dock) 性能与替换策略",
                      "fontFamily": "Outfit",
                      "fontSize": 20,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Q3U03",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 问题根源：Android 4.4 缺少 RenderEffect，软件模拟高斯模糊会严重拖慢帧率并引起掉帧。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vC9Nu",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 默认替代方案 (推荐)：采用『半透深色圆角板』——85% 纯黑透明底板 + 顶部 1.5px 白色高光描边，纯原生 Canvas 硬件加速直出，0 模糊开销，老电视稳跑 60fps。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Mf24A",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 渐变伪模糊 (方案二)：预先烘焙双层半透明径向/线性着色器，形成自然的暗角玻璃质感。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "L9UO6",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 动态降级检测：根据 ActivityManager.getMemoryClass() 与 SDK 版本自动建议开启『半透磨砂黑』或『极简无底板』模式。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Jggcn",
                  "name": "Card 4 - Memory & APK Size Budget",
                  "width": 882,
                  "height": 406,
                  "fill": "#1E293B",
                  "cornerRadius": 24,
                  "stroke": "#334155",
                  "strokeWidth": 1,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": [
                    28,
                    32
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "jXORA",
                      "name": "Card 4 Title",
                      "fill": "#F59E0B",
                      "content": "4. 内存控制与体积预算 (质量基线保证)",
                      "fontFamily": "Outfit",
                      "fontSize": 20,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "b20cy",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 极致体积：14 张内置壁纸采用 WebP 75 质量压缩打包，单图 < 120KB，14 张总计仅约 1.5MB，APK 体积依旧控制在极限范围内。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "tqkZS",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 零内存泄漏：全屏壁纸只保留单个活跃 Bitmap 引用，切换壁纸前主动 recycle() 旧位图，杜绝低内存设备 OOM。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "XAYCx",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 权限控制：仅在用户开启必应壁纸时使用系统标准 HttpURLConnection 下载，保持无后门、无遥测纯净架构。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "iS8ax",
                      "name": "Point Text",
                      "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                      "content": "● 闪电冷启动：冷启动时首帧优先读取当前壁纸本地小缓存或渐变色，< 1.0s 内完成首屏绘制。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
